## 7. 提交规范

```
<type>(<scope>): <subject>

type: feat | fix | docs | test | refactor | chore | perf | security
scope: frontend | backend | docs | deploy | scripts | ci
```

例：`feat(backend): 新增用户登录接口`

分支：`main`（受保护）← `develop` ← `feature/*`

